        "Description": "Recent reports indicate that 5 victims were murdered last night in the small sea side town of Sapienza.  All of the victims were either alone or lured to their place of murder, and all of victims were murdered in different ways. Authorities do not have any leads on the murderer as there were no witnesses or camera footage of it. This is the most horriffic killing in the towns history, and locals have already nicknamed him &quot;Tobias the Reaper.",
